id: pm-github-project-reference-followup
title: Audit Projects v2 reference fallback and curated item ownership
description: "Static inspection found a separate board-import path: projects.ts indexPmByIssue indexes free-form gh tags, buildProjectImportPlan uses that fallback, and index.ts runProjectImport writes title, description and body on an update. Reproduce with real SDK trackers, then define explicit board ownership and migration-free compatibility for existing gh-project markers. This is separate from the gated REST issue importer fixed by issue 230."
